{"4640450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Smawverse", "steam_appid": 4640450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smawverse is a dark fantasy bullet heaven, a survivor-like roguelite where your weapons fight for you. You play a stray cat reforged in iron, carving through the undead wreck of a kingdom that fell to its own keeper. Built in Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/208ece2b5a9d35e7720e26e20168cbaa.poster.avif?t=1787690802\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/208ece2b5a9d35e7720e26e20168cbaa.webm?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/208ece2b5a9d35e7720e26e20168cbaa.mp4?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pray to the Nine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine prophets once held the kingdom together. Now they meditate in stone. Kneel at their shrines and they loan you a fragment of the power that was once theirs. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nine prophets, each a distinct element: fire, frost, plague, shadow, arcane, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose blessings as you level mid-run. No two runs play the same. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forty-plus blessings to discover across the Nine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stack them deep enough and one cat becomes a screen-clearing storm. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/bcc16927c35dab8e82d9051b47c61600.poster.avif?t=1787690802\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/bcc16927c35dab8e82d9051b47c61600.webm?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/bcc16927c35dab8e82d9051b47c61600.mp4?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Unmade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom's own keeper raised its dead and struck the living from the page. What remains wants you gone. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hordes that escalate until the screen is a wall of enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eight weapons, each a completely different playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bosses that end your run if you built wrong. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Permadeath. The blessings return when you fall. You rise again sharper. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/f6dbcca8f108d7112eb7450ff99b0443.poster.avif?t=1787690802\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/f6dbcca8f108d7112eb7450ff99b0443.webm?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/f6dbcca8f108d7112eb7450ff99b0443.mp4?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Between Runs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end of progress. Everything you earn carries forward into the next descent.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prophet Skill Tree</strong>: a deep passive tree with a chapter for every prophet. Earn Prophet experience from the shrines you favor and spend Talent Scrolls from bosses on build-defining keystones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/16a332dc98d190ff5fff244e4619dfda.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/16a332dc98d190ff5fff244e4619dfda.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Mastery</strong>: every weapon levels on its own the more you fight with it, unlocking support nodes and a signature keystone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/4d98a539fb25d1caeab8044070b289d9.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/4d98a539fb25d1caeab8044070b289d9.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cipher Station</strong>: some loot drops with affixes you cannot read. Start deciphering and there is no backing out. You commit, then choose between the original roll and a hidden alternate. Whichever you keep comes out stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/e59e769abf1ab6d64a8c76f1875c24d8.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/e59e769abf1ab6d64a8c76f1875c24d8.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capes</strong>: unlock a wardrobe of prophet-themed cloaks by mastering each prophet. Some carry a small edge in battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/1898b8dcaaddb3894d8e716d345fcb4b.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/1898b8dcaaddb3894d8e716d345fcb4b.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A hideout that restores as you progress, the last standing corner of a fallen street, with a stash that carries between runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/702ad8c6f293151a8e90ba3582334f0a.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/702ad8c6f293151a8e90ba3582334f0a.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story, For Those Who Want It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was a kingdom called the Daughter of the Sea. Its strength was not armies. It was nine prophets, one sacred scripture called the Word, and a people who fed each other's cats. The man who kept the Word wanted the power it would never give him. So he took it, and he unmade the kingdom with it. The prophets had one failsafe left: a word that could never be written, and a stray cat to carry it. That cat is you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One cat. Nine prophets. A stolen scripture and the thing that took it. Take back the Word. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smawverse is a dark fantasy bullet heaven, a survivor-like roguelite where your weapons fight for you. You play a stray cat reforged in iron, carving through the undead wreck of a kingdom that fell to its own keeper. Built in Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/208ece2b5a9d35e7720e26e20168cbaa.poster.avif?t=1787690802\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/208ece2b5a9d35e7720e26e20168cbaa.webm?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/208ece2b5a9d35e7720e26e20168cbaa.mp4?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pray to the Nine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine prophets once held the kingdom together. Now they meditate in stone. Kneel at their shrines and they loan you a fragment of the power that was once theirs. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nine prophets, each a distinct element: fire, frost, plague, shadow, arcane, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose blessings as you level mid-run. No two runs play the same. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forty-plus blessings to discover across the Nine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stack them deep enough and one cat becomes a screen-clearing storm. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/bcc16927c35dab8e82d9051b47c61600.poster.avif?t=1787690802\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/bcc16927c35dab8e82d9051b47c61600.webm?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/bcc16927c35dab8e82d9051b47c61600.mp4?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Unmade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom's own keeper raised its dead and struck the living from the page. What remains wants you gone. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hordes that escalate until the screen is a wall of enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eight weapons, each a completely different playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bosses that end your run if you built wrong. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Permadeath. The blessings return when you fall. You rise again sharper. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/f6dbcca8f108d7112eb7450ff99b0443.poster.avif?t=1787690802\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/f6dbcca8f108d7112eb7450ff99b0443.webm?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/f6dbcca8f108d7112eb7450ff99b0443.mp4?t=1787690802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Between Runs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end of progress. Everything you earn carries forward into the next descent.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prophet Skill Tree</strong>: a deep passive tree with a chapter for every prophet. Earn Prophet experience from the shrines you favor and spend Talent Scrolls from bosses on build-defining keystones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/16a332dc98d190ff5fff244e4619dfda.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/16a332dc98d190ff5fff244e4619dfda.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Mastery</strong>: every weapon levels on its own the more you fight with it, unlocking support nodes and a signature keystone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/4d98a539fb25d1caeab8044070b289d9.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/4d98a539fb25d1caeab8044070b289d9.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cipher Station</strong>: some loot drops with affixes you cannot read. Start deciphering and there is no backing out. You commit, then choose between the original roll and a hidden alternate. Whichever you keep comes out stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/e59e769abf1ab6d64a8c76f1875c24d8.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/e59e769abf1ab6d64a8c76f1875c24d8.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capes</strong>: unlock a wardrobe of prophet-themed cloaks by mastering each prophet. Some carry a small edge in battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/1898b8dcaaddb3894d8e716d345fcb4b.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/1898b8dcaaddb3894d8e716d345fcb4b.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A hideout that restores as you progress, the last standing corner of a fallen street, with a stash that carries between runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras/702ad8c6f293151a8e90ba3582334f0a.avif?t=1787690802\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/extras_big/702ad8c6f293151a8e90ba3582334f0a.avif?t=1787690802 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story, For Those Who Want It</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was a kingdom called the Daughter of the Sea. Its strength was not armies. It was nine prophets, one sacred scripture called the Word, and a people who fed each other's cats. The man who kept the Word wanted the power it would never give him. So he took it, and he unmade the kingdom with it. The prophets had one failsafe left: a word that could never be written, and a stray cat to carry it. That cat is you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One cat. Nine prophets. A stolen scripture and the thing that took it. Take back the Word. </p>", "short_description": "Cut down the risen dead in this dark fantasy bullet-heaven roguelike. You are Smaw, a stray cat reforged in iron to take back a kingdom unmade by its own keeper. Kneel at nine prophet shrines and stack their blessings into screen-clearing builds. How long can you last?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/f90084e5cd23bbdd899a967784fa1dc13f65c7fe/header.jpg?t=1787690802", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640450/230ebeb864d2690d2601a67096fdf70f50d1bdbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787690802", "capsul