 explode on death), zombie bite attacks at close range, and persistent corpses in the environment. The setting is bleak and gothic, a fallen kingdom overrun by its own dead.\r\n\r\nThe game includes a Vendor station where the player spends in-game tokens (earned exclusively through gameplay, never purchased with real money) to buy items of random rarity. This is a standard mechanic in the roguelike and ARPG genre. No real-money purchases exist anywhere in the game.\r\n\r\nThere is no sexual content, no nudity, no real-world hate speech, no drugs, and no in-game chat. The mature content is exclusively combat violence and dark atmosphere."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "12", "required_age": "12", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Violência"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "16", "required_age": "16", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Gewalt"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Horor\nKekerasan"}}}}}